  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting policy engagement for biodiversity related processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia is home to diverse ecosystems and rich biodiversity that are increasingly affected by climate change, land degradation and unsustainable use of natural resources. This activity will strengthen the engagement of Central Asian countries and stakeholders in international biodiversity and sustainability processes by strengthening science-policy interface and promoting local knowledge. It will support policy dialogue, knowledge sharing and capacity building related to biodiversity conservation, ecosystem restoration, and ecosystem-based climate solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
